The userspace runtime here — USB transport, CSR/DMA handling, the executable
loader and the execution engine — is a Rust port derived from that Apache-2.0
source, with the TensorFlow Lite dependency removed. It is a licensed
derivative work, not a clean-room reimplementation.

cay-program/schema/executable.fbs is Google's DarwiNN executable IDL,
reproduced unmodified; cay-program/src/executable_generated.rs is flatc output
from it, which is why both retain the platforms.darwinn namespace.

